name: "OWID CO2 emissions per capita"
description: "Annual carbon dioxide (CO2) emissions per person from burning fossil fuels and industrial processes (transport, electricity generation, heating, cement), excluding land-use change, in tonnes of CO2 per person. Emissions come from the Global Carbon Project's Global Carbon Budget and are divided by population estimates from multiple sources; compiled and processed by Our World in Data for every country and the World."
